/Title (The proposed system follows a client-server architecture composed of frontend, backend, and rule evaluation components to support efficient management of research proposal submissions. The frontend is developed using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to provide user interfaces for submitting proposal information, uploading documents, and monitoring submission status, while the backend uses Node.js and Express.js to handle request processing, file validation, and rule-based evaluation.)
